# Weathered Runestone: "Nonland permanent cards in graveyards and libraries can't enter the battlefield" (CR 101.2,
# 110.4a). Bot1 casts the Runestone and Goblin Welder, then Faithless Looting, discarding Phyrexian Metamorph (an
# artifact creature card) and Mox Pearl (a noncreature artifact card, which Grafdigger's Cage would let in). Goblin Welder
# sacrifices Mox Jet for the Metamorph and then Mox Ruby for Mox Pearl: each Mox is sacrificed, but neither card in the
# graveyard returns, and the Metamorph is never asked what to copy.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Weathered Runestone
Goblin Welder
Faithless Looting
Phyrexian Metamorph
Mox Pearl
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Weathered Runestone.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Goblin Welder.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Phyrexian Metamorph; Mox Pearl)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Welder.Activate
Bot1.Target(Mox Jet)
Bot1.Target(Phyrexian Metamorph)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Graveyard = Mox Jet; Faithless Looting; Mox Pearl; Phyrexian Metamorph; Black Lotus
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Welder.Activate
Bot1.Target(Mox Ruby)
Bot1.Target(Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield = Goblin Welder; Mountain; Weathered Runestone
Bot1.Graveyard = Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Faithless Looting; Mox Pearl; Phyrexian Metamorph; Black Lotus
